### 1. Direct Target Service Check (Port 8081)
GET http://localhost:8081/internal/accounts
Accept: application/json

### 2. Direct Target Service with ID (Port 8081)
GET http://localhost:8081/internal/accounts/ACC001
Accept: application/json

### 3. Public API Gateway with Path Rewriting (Port 8080) -> Rewritten to Port 8081
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/
Accept: application/json

### 4. Public API Gateway without Trailing Slash (Port 8080)
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts
Accept: application/json

### 5. Public API Gateway with Account ID (Port 8080) -> Rewritten to Port 8081
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC001
Accept: application/json
